2\n糟…糟…糟了…\n&王赟\n怎…怎么会这样？快…快…快跑！\n&步兵2\n不行了，脚不听使唤…"]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,254,0,0,0,0,0,6,1,0,10,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,258,0,0,0,0,0,6,1,0,10,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,259,0,0,0,0,0,6,1,0,10,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,260,0,0,0,0,0,6,1,0,10,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,261,0,0,0,0,0,6,1,0,10,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[1014]]},"end":64},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,17,0,0,0,0,0,6,0,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,17,0,0,0,0,0,6,1,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,15,0,0,0,0,0,6,0,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,15,0,0,0,0,0,6,1,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&廖化\n呵呵，现在赶快歼灭这批敌军，接下来\n还有另一批等著我们歼灭。\n&张翼\n元俭还真是厉害，不作为我军先锋在前面\n打仗太可惜了。\n&廖化\n唉…要是我做先锋恐怕会被贼军嘲笑吧，\n笑我大汉没人，派个老家伙上阵。\n&张翼\n笑话！人家廉颇老将军八十几岁都上阵\n打前锋，元俭你现在也不过五十多…\n&廖化\n哈哈哈…那就让我们两个老家伙来发威\n一下给后面的年轻人看吧。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[58]},{"op":25,"name":"victory_cond_text","args":["胜利条件\n一﹑打倒郭淮。\n\n失败条件\n一﹑姜维死亡。\n二﹑回合数超过30。"]},{"op":26,"name":"battle_goal_text","args":["一﹑打倒郭淮。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["印绶条件\n全灭敌人。"]},{"op":90,"name":"ui_5a","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_result","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":1,"offset":12566,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":12568,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[17,254,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[46]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[17,254,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[254,17,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&廖化\n刚才好笑吗？现在应该笑不出来了吧！\n&王赟\n啰…啰唆！"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":2,"name